WEBVTT

01:36.690 --> 01:39.950
[NORTHWARD]

01:40.080 --> 01:41.910
[Episode 19]

01:59.830 --> 02:00.830
Siyi.

02:07.220 --> 02:08.520
Why haven't you gone home yet?

02:28.180 --> 02:29.290
I'm not you,

02:29.470 --> 02:30.790
so I can't

02:30.810 --> 02:32.930
really understand how upset you are.

02:35.310 --> 02:37.710
I just feel that if Granny were here,

02:39.550 --> 02:41.230
she definitely wouldn't want you to be like this.

02:42.560 --> 02:44.520
Granny would want you

02:46.190 --> 02:47.310
to be happy.

02:50.420 --> 02:51.520
Actually...

02:53.870 --> 02:56.270
Actually, I'm not that upset anymore.

02:57.670 --> 02:59.430
It's just that there's this anger inside

03:00.150 --> 03:01.030
that I can't release.

03:02.830 --> 03:03.510
It's suffocating.

03:08.350 --> 03:09.500
You're angry, huh?

03:10.430 --> 03:10.950
Wait.

03:21.770 --> 03:24.910
[Final battle in June, let's meet at Tsinghua and Peking]

03:27.870 --> 03:29.310
If we can't say it, just write it.

03:31.120 --> 03:32.320
Write what?

03:32.360 --> 03:34.310
All the emotions, the pressure,

03:34.310 --> 03:35.880
and everything you want to express.

03:35.880 --> 03:36.710
You can even curse if you want.

03:38.950 --> 03:40.950
[Final battle in June, let's meet at Tsinghua and Peking]

03:40.630 --> 03:42.780
Liu Chang,

03:43.390 --> 03:45.270
idiot!

03:47.500 --> 03:48.870
He didn't do anything to you.

03:48.870 --> 03:49.990
Isn't it just about the class monitor election?

03:49.990 --> 03:50.829
How did he not do anything to me?

03:50.829 --> 03:52.030
He's always tattling on me.

03:56.579 --> 03:57.570
Come on!

04:06.990 --> 04:08.080
Write whatever you want.

04:14.900 --> 04:19.240
[DIE, FUNCTION!]

04:18.690 --> 04:19.350
My...

04:21.450 --> 04:22.120
Mom...

04:23.040 --> 04:27.880
[I HATE MY MOM!]

04:23.720 --> 04:24.650
I agree!

04:25.270 --> 04:26.110
Mine too!

04:26.260 --> 04:26.990
Same.

05:00.390 --> 05:01.360
Let's erase it.

05:02.450 --> 05:04.310
Erase all these negative things

05:04.310 --> 05:05.070
that affect our mood.

05:16.350 --> 05:17.830
Why is there a pig head?

05:17.850 --> 05:19.140
Put some effort into it.

05:24.690 --> 05:26.380
♫Running with all my might♫

05:27.050 --> 05:29.480
♫I don't care about what others say♫

05:30.470 --> 05:32.010
♫My blood is burning hot♫

05:33.240 --> 05:34.980
♫I won't let myself fall♫

05:34.310 --> 05:35.070
Thank you.

05:35.880 --> 05:36.720
You're welcome.

05:36.120 --> 05:38.510
♫I don't want endless nagging and chatter♫

05:39.470 --> 05:41.050
♫Words that make no sense♫

05:42.140 --> 05:43.700
♫Head up, I race forward with a roar♫

05:44.520 --> 05:46.850
♫Facing all those staring eyes♫

05:48.159 --> 05:49.590
♫Years from now♫

05:50.150 --> 05:51.909
The Olympic flame will return to Beijing

05:50.520 --> 05:54.310
[Wang, Reporter]

05:50.620 --> 05:53.130
♫Time will prove it all♫

05:51.909 --> 05:53.190
on August 6

05:53.190 --> 05:55.350
and be relayed through various districts and counties,

05:54.170 --> 05:57.100
♫The charm that we gained and lost♫

05:55.350 --> 05:56.950
passing by 56 scenic spots.

05:56.950 --> 05:58.340
It will arrive at the Bird's Nest

05:57.900 --> 05:59.740
♫Time gently chases on♫

05:58.340 --> 06:00.550
on the evening of August 8 to ignite the main cauldron.

06:00.360 --> 06:02.290
♫I'll never regret♫

06:01.510 --> 06:02.390
Beijing

06:02.590 --> 06:03.860
is the longing of everyone

06:03.860 --> 06:05.790
from that year.

06:03.970 --> 06:05.360
♫Our prideful youth♫

06:06.310 --> 06:09.110
And it is also the final stop of the canal

06:06.450 --> 06:08.720
♫Nothing else mattered♫

06:09.110 --> 06:10.750
that the rising new generation from Flower Street

06:09.690 --> 06:11.280
♫Time quietly flies by♫

06:10.750 --> 06:12.380
had been longing for.

06:11.780 --> 06:13.510
♫I don't want to regret♫

06:13.070 --> 06:15.710
Where will the waves they encountered

06:14.860 --> 06:16.650
♫The pride among the stars♫

06:15.870 --> 06:18.980
as children flow to when they are

06:17.970 --> 06:20.340
♫Keep running♫

06:19.110 --> 06:20.160
in their 20s and 30s?

06:20.750 --> 06:22.270
What did the water that passed through

06:21.500 --> 06:24.380
♫Keep running♫

06:22.270 --> 06:24.270
Flower Street become in the end?

06:24.740 --> 06:27.220
No matter what circumstances we face,

06:27.300 --> 06:28.610
with direction

06:28.610 --> 06:29.790
comes hope.

06:30.750 --> 06:32.990
The canal gave them guidance.

06:33.010 --> 06:36.370
The future, however, is something they must seek for themselves.

06:37.050 --> 06:38.770
The great river

06:38.790 --> 06:40.370
flows northward.

06:39.980 --> 06:41.960
♫Running with all my might♫

06:40.590 --> 06:42.030
The vitality of youth

06:42.030 --> 06:44.040
is like the rushing river,

06:42.840 --> 06:44.640
♫I don't care about what others say♫

06:44.380 --> 06:45.490
surging

06:45.850 --> 06:47.130
with passion.

06:45.970 --> 06:47.540
♫My blood is burning hot♫

06:48.190 --> 06:50.530
♫I won't let myself fall♫

06:51.050 --> 06:53.970
♫Years from now♫

06:53.060 --> 06:54.780
Alas!

06:54.880 --> 06:57.080
♫Time will prove it all♫

06:55.830 --> 06:57.420
How steep! How high!

06:58.210 --> 07:02.380
♫Everything gained and lost♫

06:59.150 --> 07:01.390
The road to Shu

07:01.390 --> 07:03.710
is harder than climbing to the sky.

07:03.940 --> 07:06.710
Since the two pioneers, Can Cong and Yu Fu...

07:04.990 --> 07:06.570
♫Time gently chases on♫

07:07.460 --> 07:09.320
♫I'll never regret♫

07:10.120 --> 07:12.430
♫Our prideful youth♫

07:12.510 --> 07:13.350
What's wrong?

07:13.090 --> 07:15.370
♫Nothing else mattered♫

07:15.930 --> 07:17.720
♫Time quietly flies by♫

07:18.550 --> 07:20.460
♫I'll never regret♫

07:21.340 --> 07:23.470
♫The pride among the stars♫

07:21.950 --> 07:23.670
My child has really suffered.

07:24.160 --> 07:26.670
♫Keep running♫

07:25.630 --> 07:26.590
Mom...

07:27.750 --> 07:29.110
Draw the sword

07:28.890 --> 07:31.250
♫Blood burning hot♫

07:29.190 --> 07:30.470
and show its sharp edge!

07:30.630 --> 07:33.420
Fight for glory in the college entrance exam!

07:32.640 --> 07:35.170
♫Blood burning hot♫

07:35.150 --> 07:37.390
One, two, three, four!

07:37.970 --> 07:40.170
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

07:38.050 --> 07:39.020
Zhou Haikuo.

07:39.909 --> 07:40.840
Qin Qi.

07:42.690 --> 07:43.440
Yang Dahong.

07:43.480 --> 07:44.070
Here.

07:45.570 --> 07:46.560
Shao Xingchi.

07:48.210 --> 07:49.050
Xie Wanghe.

07:49.100 --> 07:49.750
Here.

07:54.220 --> 07:55.030
Qiu Min.

07:55.130 --> 07:55.690
Here.

07:57.300 --> 07:57.990
Everyone, stop chatting.

07:58.030 --> 07:58.750
Stop chatting.

08:00.190 --> 08:01.670
Everyone, quickly lower your heads

08:01.790 --> 08:03.560
and check your admission ticket

08:03.670 --> 08:05.150
Is your name written correctly?

08:05.200 --> 08:06.940
[Admission Certificate]

08:05.430 --> 08:06.990
Is your admission ticket number correct?

08:07.030 --> 08:08.570
This is your last chance.

08:09.160 --> 08:10.360
After you go home,

08:10.590 --> 08:12.790
make sure to keep your admission ticket safe.

08:13.310 --> 08:14.310
Don't lose it.

08:14.630 --> 08:16.510
Otherwise, the past three years of high school,

08:16.710 --> 08:18.750
or even the past ten years of study,

08:19.070 --> 08:20.150
will be in vain!

08:21.640 --> 08:22.600
Later,

08:22.910 --> 08:24.530
I will take you to see the exam venue.

08:24.690 --> 08:26.180
Afterward,

08:26.630 --> 08:27.630
go home and get some good rest.

08:28.520 --> 08:30.340
Don't try to cram in the next few days.

08:30.630 --> 08:31.660
If you haven't worked hard before, cramming now won't help.

08:31.950 --> 08:33.020
Don't stay up late.

08:33.270 --> 08:34.270
Conserve your energy

08:34.190 --> 08:37.520
[Striving unceasingly with steadfast integrity]

08:34.299 --> 08:36.190
and get prepared for the final sprint!

08:36.549 --> 08:37.600
Do you understand?

08:37.710 --> 08:39.150
Yes!

08:39.190 --> 08:39.870
Come on!

08:39.909 --> 08:41.270
Let's shout our slogan

08:41.309 --> 08:42.919
one last time!

08:43.630 --> 08:45.670
Youth's passion,

08:45.700 --> 08:47.460
strive for strength!

08:47.590 --> 08:51.070
With determination and fighting spirit, we charge forward!

08:51.270 --> 08:53.140
Draw the sword

08:53.190 --> 08:54.670
and show its sharp edge!

08:55.070 --> 08:58.720
Fight for glory in the college entrance exam!

09:06.150 --> 09:06.790
Dad.

09:07.910 --> 09:08.590
You're back.

09:08.620 --> 09:09.550
Hurry up and eat.

09:09.840 --> 09:10.550
Where's Mom?

09:10.630 --> 09:11.510
She's not back yet?

09:11.600 --> 09:12.630
Your mom is on her way.

09:12.830 --> 09:14.630
She'll definitely make it back tonight.

09:15.630 --> 09:17.510
You have the exam tomorrow.

09:17.710 --> 09:19.310
She'll definitely rush back.

09:25.620 --> 09:26.780
Stop dawdling.

09:26.910 --> 09:27.590
Hurry and eat.

09:28.390 --> 09:29.110
What are you doing?

09:29.830 --> 09:30.390
They...

09:31.510 --> 09:32.630
They are all over the wall.

09:32.630 --> 09:33.670
It's really annoying to look at.

09:34.390 --> 09:35.070
Besides,

09:36.830 --> 09:38.310
these things are all in the past.

09:43.390 --> 09:44.070
Look.

09:46.430 --> 09:49.690
[Motor Vehicle Driving License of the People's Republic of China]

09:50.390 --> 09:51.710
You got your license so quickly?

09:52.640 --> 09:53.310
[Motor Vehicle Driving License of the People's Republic of China]

09:52.820 --> 09:53.910
It was not that hard.

09:53.820 --> 09:54.190
[Motor Vehicle Driving License of the People's Republic of China]

09:55.070 --> 09:56.070
From now on,

09:59.710 --> 10:00.790
your mom and I

10:00.950 --> 10:01.810
will take turns

10:02.140 --> 10:02.910
driving the cab.

10:02.910 --> 10:04.150
Hand me that rod.

10:07.600 --> 10:09.490
Your mom and I will take shifts

10:09.710 --> 10:10.240
to drive the cab.

10:10.350 --> 10:11.430
As for the affairs at home,

10:11.630 --> 10:12.670
don't worry about them.

10:13.150 --> 10:13.870
Just focus on your studies.

10:18.240 --> 10:18.910
Dad.

10:20.230 --> 10:20.990
I'm sorry.

10:25.900 --> 10:27.930
What trouble have you gotten into now, you brat?

10:31.670 --> 10:32.270
Dad,

10:33.190 --> 10:33.870
I've grown up.

10:35.230 --> 10:36.350
When I get into college

10:36.620 --> 10:37.730
and start earning money,

10:38.990 --> 10:40.260
I'll buy you a big ship.

10:43.690 --> 10:45.510
Alright, I'll be waiting for you.

10:46.510 --> 10:48.990
I want the biggest ship.

10:50.820 --> 10:51.820
How about a 10,000-ton ship?

10:53.780 --> 10:55.290
Cut the crap.

10:55.580 --> 10:57.740
Can a 10,000-ton ship even run on that river?

10:57.840 --> 10:59.490
You're making empty promises again, aren't you?

11:01.640 --> 11:02.650
You little brat!

11:02.680 --> 11:03.190
Come here!

11:03.190 --> 11:04.960
Put the knife down!

11:10.740 --> 11:11.840
Put the knife down!

11:12.150 --> 11:13.470
How dare you!

11:13.630 --> 11:15.110
Xingchi, what are you doing?

11:15.140 --> 11:16.110
He hit my mom!

11:16.150 --> 11:16.740
You...

11:17.660 --> 11:19.180
Why did you drink during the day?

11:19.200 --> 11:19.790
Indeed.

11:19.900 --> 11:21.050
Your kid is taking the college entrance exam tomorrow.

11:21.070 --> 11:22.040
What are you doing?

11:25.870 --> 11:27.650
If you want to kill me, just do it!

11:27.710 --> 11:29.660
I've long since stopped living like a human anyway!

11:30.750 --> 11:32.030
What are you talking about?

11:32.030 --> 11:32.750
What... what's going on here?

11:32.750 --> 11:33.960
Don't pull me!

11:35.270 --> 11:36.270
Mr. Zhou,

11:36.380 --> 11:37.510
do you know that I'm writing

11:37.510 --> 11:38.630
The Story of Flower Street?

11:38.740 --> 11:41.030
Yes, I do. I've been looking forward to it.

11:41.350 --> 11:42.380
I was halfway through writing this book

11:42.380 --> 11:43.990
when I went to apply for a cultural project,

11:44.840 --> 11:46.220
but it got rejected.

11:46.470 --> 11:47.810
Today, I found out

11:48.170 --> 11:49.680
that the only spot at the cultural museum

11:49.720 --> 11:51.280
went to Chen Bo.

11:51.870 --> 11:53.420
Guess what he said about me?

11:53.630 --> 11:54.970
He said I was jealous of him.

11:55.470 --> 11:57.060
What does he have that I should be jealous of?

11:57.280 --> 11:59.240
Why would I be jealous of a guy

11:59.270 --> 12:00.510
who lives off his wife?

12:00.550 --> 12:01.830
Alright. Why did you mention this?

12:01.850 --> 12:02.440
Mr. Shao, Mr. Shao.

12:02.480 --> 12:03.610
Hurry up and go back to studying!

12:03.830 --> 12:05.960
I rely on my own abilities to make a living,

12:06.510 --> 12:08.900
yet my son keeps making sarcastic comments by my side.

12:08.990 --> 12:09.960
Who wouldn't feel bad...

12:09.980 --> 12:11.180
Xingchi, Xingchi!

12:11.210 --> 12:12.620
You were the one being sarcastic first!

12:12.870 --> 12:13.990
You were the one being sarcastic first!

12:13.990 --> 12:16.380
If you're so capable, get into a good university first,

12:16.790 --> 12:17.750
then come and mock me!

12:17.750 --> 12:18.610
To hell with good universities!

12:18.950 --> 12:20.040
You're from a good university, aren't you?

12:20.630 --> 12:22.170
But you have to pay to publish your own books!

12:22.190 --> 12:22.910
How proud you must be!

12:22.910 --> 12:24.160
You bastard!

12:24.550 --> 12:25.230
Stop it!

12:25.260 --> 12:26.550
Both of you, stop it!

12:27.120 --> 12:29.350
Mr. Shao, what's more important now?

12:29.670 --> 12:31.610
Why are you saying this now?

12:32.150 --> 12:33.710
Don't take frustration you feel at work out

12:33.710 --> 12:35.390
on your wife and kid.

12:35.390 --> 12:36.110
Exactly.

12:36.830 --> 12:37.590
Listen to me.

12:37.610 --> 12:38.390
Apologize to your child.

12:38.420 --> 12:39.030
Go on. Go, go, go.

12:39.030 --> 12:39.870
You just need to apologize to him.

12:39.870 --> 12:40.390
Apologize.

12:40.390 --> 12:41.510
Apologize to him.

12:41.550 --> 12:42.800
I apologize to him?

12:43.410 --> 12:45.500
A father apologizing to his son?

12:45.530 --> 12:47.640
Is there any justice in this world?

12:47.710 --> 12:49.390
I raised him for eighteen years for nothing?

12:49.390 --> 12:50.520
Shao Bingyi!

12:50.610 --> 12:51.450
Remember this!

12:51.740 --> 12:53.710
From now on, I won't need you to support me anymore!

12:54.150 --> 12:55.310
You're selfish and self-centered!

12:55.570 --> 12:56.260
All you have is a degree,

12:56.260 --> 12:57.330
but you're useless at work!

12:57.350 --> 12:59.150
Every time you drink, you end up hitting my mom!

13:00.170 --> 13:01.630
You want me to succeed, right?

13:02.520 --> 13:04.100
I'm not taking the college entrance exam!

13:10.270 --> 13:11.030
Don't move!

13:11.030 --> 13:11.510
Kid!

13:11.550 --> 13:12.240
Xingchi!

13:12.510 --> 13:13.670
How did this...

13:14.750 --> 13:15.990
Yuling, this...

13:16.990 --> 13:17.500
What should we do?

13:17.550 --> 13:17.870
Let's go, let's go.

13:17.910 --> 13:18.340
What should we do?

13:18.550 --> 13:19.830
Quickly, carry her into the room!

13:19.910 --> 13:20.910
Get her inside the room, hurry!

13:20.910 --> 13:21.510
Hurry!

13:22.390 --> 13:23.110
Gosh.

13:24.510 --> 13:25.230
Hurry up.

13:25.470 --> 13:26.230
Hurry up.

14:07.310 --> 14:07.980
Mom,

14:10.270 --> 14:10.950
I'm not going to college.

14:10.950 --> 14:11.990
Let me take you away.

14:17.830 --> 14:18.960
Where to?

14:20.360 --> 14:22.160
As long as it's away from here and away from him,

14:24.050 --> 14:25.230
we can go anywhere.

14:26.230 --> 14:28.280
Your dad just has a bad temper

14:29.520 --> 14:30.970
and speaks harshly,

14:31.490 --> 14:33.860
but he did a lot for us!

14:34.070 --> 14:35.880
No matter how much he has done for us, he has worn down our gratitude.

14:38.470 --> 14:39.600
Mom, trust me.

14:40.480 --> 14:41.540
I have hands and feet.

14:42.130 --> 14:43.900
If we leave him, we'll live better.

14:44.710 --> 14:46.040
I won't let you suffer.

14:56.710 --> 14:58.830
Are you trying to give your mother a heart attack?

15:01.230 --> 15:02.750
You think you've got it all figured out, huh?

15:03.300 --> 15:05.250
College is right around the corner,

15:05.290 --> 15:07.440
and you said you wouldn't go!

15:07.470 --> 15:10.140
You even tore up your admission ticket!

15:10.160 --> 15:11.640
You're unbelievable.

15:11.670 --> 15:13.440
You're so childish.

15:13.860 --> 15:16.960
What am I supposed to do with you?

15:17.560 --> 15:19.520
Going to college or not isn't that important, Mom.

15:22.470 --> 15:24.010
As long as we leave that drunkard,

15:24.910 --> 15:26.660
life will definitely be better than it is now.

15:31.070 --> 15:32.340
Mom, I know.

15:33.220 --> 15:34.790
I know you're afraid I'll suffer,

15:35.500 --> 15:36.630
or be mistreated.

15:38.390 --> 15:38.940
I was a kid before

15:38.940 --> 15:40.190
and couldn't take care of myself.

15:41.020 --> 15:41.990
But I'm different now.

15:41.990 --> 15:42.800
I've grown up.

15:43.720 --> 15:44.830
I've grown up.

15:45.880 --> 15:46.950
From now on,

15:47.790 --> 15:49.360
you have to learn to live for yourself.

16:46.390 --> 16:47.070
Here.

16:47.720 --> 16:48.520
Take a break.

16:49.160 --> 16:50.360
Have the soup before you go back to studying.

16:52.300 --> 16:53.230
I'm not hungry.

16:53.960 --> 16:55.320
You didn't have dinner.

16:55.510 --> 16:56.430
Are you cultivating?

16:56.740 --> 16:57.340
Drink it up.

17:05.130 --> 17:07.310
What university do you want to go to?

17:08.339 --> 17:09.470
Honghuai Normal University.

17:12.089 --> 17:13.470
With your grades,

17:13.910 --> 17:15.880
you could get into a top university.

17:16.260 --> 17:18.420
I'm going to a normal university because it's close to home.

17:22.950 --> 17:24.490
You want to stay with your grandma, right?

17:32.840 --> 17:33.330
Well...

17:34.070 --> 17:34.950
now,

17:35.580 --> 17:36.780
you don't have to.

17:40.670 --> 17:43.230
You can choose a university that suits you.

17:43.580 --> 17:45.020
Normal universities suit me just fine.

17:46.600 --> 17:48.350
How much money can you make as a teacher?

17:48.380 --> 17:49.110
Listen to me.

17:49.670 --> 17:50.970
Choose finance,

17:51.090 --> 17:52.070
or accounting.

17:52.270 --> 17:53.390
Go to a university in a big city.

17:54.430 --> 17:55.520
After graduation, work hard

17:55.730 --> 17:57.530
and get a household registration in a first-tier city.

17:57.710 --> 17:59.420
Then you can bring your brother there too.

17:59.530 --> 18:00.150
And I'll...

18:03.320 --> 18:04.540
You don't need to take care of me.

18:04.790 --> 18:05.480
Really.

18:06.860 --> 18:09.470
But your brother is your blood after all.

18:09.500 --> 18:11.200
You should take care of him.

18:11.530 --> 18:12.040
Come on.

18:12.080 --> 18:13.870
How do you want me to take care of him?

18:14.070 --> 18:15.440
Take him everywhere I go?

18:15.640 --> 18:17.320
Spend all the money I earn in the future on him?

18:17.430 --> 18:18.550
When he gets married, should I

18:18.550 --> 18:19.600
buy him a house?

18:20.090 --> 18:21.840
You left me to my grandma because you didn't want the trouble.

18:21.960 --> 18:23.450
Now you want to leave Siwei to me.

18:23.830 --> 18:26.250
If you don't want to be a mom, why did you have us?

18:27.220 --> 18:29.150
This kid. We were just having a normal conversation.

18:29.180 --> 18:30.570
Why are you getting worked up again?

18:31.670 --> 18:32.950
We're family.

18:32.950 --> 18:34.190
I'm doing this for your good.

18:41.690 --> 18:43.260
Have you eaten gunpowder or something?

18:43.280 --> 18:44.990
Why do you throw tantrums at me from time to time?

18:45.260 --> 18:46.810
Who spoiled you like this?

18:50.070 --> 18:51.950
I gave birth to such a heartless child.

19:05.230 --> 19:05.960
Son.

19:07.050 --> 19:07.860
Mom?

19:07.990 --> 19:09.460
When did you come back?

19:09.480 --> 19:10.420
Last night.

19:10.870 --> 19:11.910
I couldn't

19:12.130 --> 19:13.400
miss today.

19:14.370 --> 19:15.110
Thank you, Mom.

19:15.190 --> 19:16.030
Have a seat.

19:16.950 --> 19:17.630
Dad.

19:19.550 --> 19:20.520
Scholar Congee.

19:20.820 --> 19:21.740
Number One Scholar Cake.

19:23.770 --> 19:24.790
I got these recipes

19:24.790 --> 19:26.550
from a cookbook from the Ming dynasty.

19:26.990 --> 19:27.810
Hurry up and try them.

19:27.960 --> 19:29.020
They might not taste good, though.

19:29.230 --> 19:29.870
Thank you, Dad.

19:35.750 --> 19:36.450
ID card.

19:36.490 --> 19:37.030
ID card.

19:37.070 --> 19:37.710
Admission ticket.

19:37.830 --> 19:39.040
Ad... Admission ticket?

19:39.230 --> 19:40.910
This is the admission ticket.

19:41.070 --> 19:41.710
Isn't it right here?

19:41.750 --> 19:42.310
Ballpoint pen.

19:42.340 --> 19:43.030
Ballpoint pen.

19:43.030 --> 19:43.820
Ballpoint pen.

19:43.910 --> 19:44.280
Pencil.

19:44.310 --> 19:45.070
Pencil.

19:45.110 --> 19:45.510
Eraser...

19:45.550 --> 19:46.230
-Pencil sharpener.
-Pencil sharpener.

19:46.270 --> 19:47.070
They're all here.

19:47.070 --> 19:47.670
They're all here.

19:47.710 --> 19:48.510
All set?

19:49.170 --> 19:49.960
Are you done?

19:50.160 --> 19:50.910
I'm feeling better now.

19:52.350 --> 19:53.210
Son,

19:53.640 --> 19:54.640
we've checked again.

19:54.670 --> 19:55.310
Everything's in there.

19:58.200 --> 19:59.780
If you don't know the answer, pick B.

19:59.910 --> 20:01.350
If there are too many Bs, pick C.

20:01.350 --> 20:02.700
Just pick one.

20:02.700 --> 20:05.100
Don't leave it blank. Got it?

20:05.190 --> 20:07.470
He knows. He doesn't need you to tell him.

20:07.790 --> 20:08.630
Fenghua,

20:08.950 --> 20:10.510
just do your best.

20:10.510 --> 20:12.030
You got this.

20:12.030 --> 20:14.670
He's my son. Of course, he's got this.

20:15.890 --> 20:16.680
Haikuo!

20:17.110 --> 20:17.780
Hurry up.

20:17.900 --> 20:18.610
Coming.

20:39.960 --> 20:40.870
Do your best.

20:43.790 --> 20:44.700
Deserter.

20:48.830 --> 20:50.330
I can't take the exam this year...

20:51.510 --> 20:53.150
But I still have a chance next year.

20:54.850 --> 20:55.790
You two are just

20:55.790 --> 20:57.030
graduating a year earlier than me.

21:29.000 --> 21:31.860
Beijing welcomes you.

21:35.340 --> 21:37.960
We'll create a new world for you.

21:38.740 --> 21:43.340
The charm in motion is vibrant with energy.

21:45.510 --> 21:48.670
Beijing welcomes you.

21:49.230 --> 21:53.030
Those with dreams are extraordinary.

21:53.880 --> 21:58.850
Where there's courage, there's a miracle.

22:21.890 --> 22:24.110
Today is the first day of the 2008 college entrance examination.

22:24.180 --> 22:25.870
This year, the national plan for university enrollment

22:24.220 --> 22:32.410
[News Simulcast]

22:25.870 --> 22:27.030
is 5.99 million,

22:27.030 --> 22:29.110
with 10.5 million applicants, making this the year

22:29.110 --> 22:30.030
with the highest number of applicants

22:30.030 --> 22:31.890
in the history of the exam.

22:32.520 --> 22:34.150
Let's turn our attention to the Jiangsu exam venues.

22:47.310 --> 22:48.510
This year's college entrance exam plan

22:48.510 --> 22:50.350
has undergone multiple adjustments and refinements,

22:50.430 --> 22:52.080
aiming to be more scientific and fair.

22:52.230 --> 22:53.830
Another feature of this year's exam

22:53.830 --> 22:55.590
is a greater emphasis on assessing comprehensive qualitie

22:55.590 --> 22:56.990
and innovative abilities.

23:00.630 --> 23:02.630
While students are striving hard,

23:02.630 --> 23:04.510
the construction of venues and preparations

23:04.510 --> 23:07.110
for the Beijing Olympics are also nearing completion.

23:08.630 --> 23:10.390
The main stadium of the Beijing Olympics,

23:10.390 --> 23:12.110
the National Stadium, Bird's Nest,

23:12.150 --> 23:14.950
is expected to hold its completion ceremony at the end of this month.

23:14.720 --> 23:17.550
[Giving our best to prepare for the college entrance exam]

23:15.390 --> 23:16.380
Everyone,

23:17.530 --> 23:19.240
in this year's college entrance exam,

23:20.220 --> 23:22.950
two students from our school

23:23.100 --> 23:24.540
have scored high enough

23:25.070 --> 23:26.190
to surpass the admission score thresholds

23:26.230 --> 23:29.020
of top national universities!

23:29.530 --> 23:30.970
They are

23:31.560 --> 23:34.360
Xie Wanghe and Zhou Haikuo

23:34.370 --> 23:36.860
from Class 3, Grade 12!

23:37.250 --> 23:39.790
Let's extend our sincerest congratulations

23:40.780 --> 23:41.910
to them.

23:41.890 --> 23:43.790
[Giving our best to prepare for the college entrance exam]

23:41.910 --> 23:43.070
Congratulations!

23:45.160 --> 23:46.160
Everyone,

23:47.030 --> 23:48.310
this is also the highest score

23:48.310 --> 23:51.400
in our school's history for the college entrance exam.

23:51.620 --> 23:54.400
Xie Wanghe and Zhou Haikuo

23:54.430 --> 23:55.870
have proven to us that

23:56.050 --> 23:58.280
as long as you have the strength

23:56.150 --> 24:01.910
[Chi]

23:58.480 --> 24:00.030
and take action,

24:00.440 --> 24:03.630
there is no mountain too high to climb.

24:15.380 --> 24:16.810
You scared me.

24:17.910 --> 24:18.770
What's wrong?

24:18.850 --> 24:20.670
Are you reluctant to graduate, just like me?

24:22.560 --> 24:24.120
I can't wait to leave here.

24:24.780 --> 24:25.730
Then why are you here?

24:28.550 --> 24:30.330
There's constant fighting at home, and it's annoying,

24:31.380 --> 24:32.220
so I'm just getting away for a bit.

24:37.200 --> 24:38.340
What are you writing?

24:40.960 --> 24:41.590
Give it to me.

24:44.840 --> 24:45.710
Wanghe,

24:46.150 --> 24:48.250
have you succeeded?

24:48.530 --> 24:49.440
What does it mean?

24:49.710 --> 24:50.910
It's for my future self.

24:51.830 --> 24:52.830
One day,

24:52.860 --> 24:54.210
when we come back to school

24:54.430 --> 24:55.950
and see these words,

24:56.030 --> 24:57.880
I hope that by then,

24:58.520 --> 25:00.630
I'll be so poor that all I have left is money.

25:03.740 --> 25:05.970
Well, I'll write something to my future self, too.

25:09.040 --> 25:10.000
Haikuo,

25:11.900 --> 25:13.290
be yourself.

25:13.550 --> 25:18.060
Don't compromise your principles for a mediocre salary.

25:21.490 --> 25:22.830
What about for a slightly higher salary?

25:22.870 --> 25:23.650
Well, I'll say thanks.

25:27.240 --> 25:28.250
Your turn.

25:43.110 --> 25:44.170
Don't regret it.

25:45.410 --> 25:47.770
Be nicer to your mom.

25:49.350 --> 25:50.520
So you know that.

25:54.250 --> 25:57.820
[Chi, don't regret it. Be good to your mom.] [Haikuo, be yourself. Don't give in to reality.]

25:57.980 --> 25:59.690
[Certificate of 2008 General College Entrance Examination Results of Honghuai City]

26:01.220 --> 26:02.100
Let me tell you,

26:02.590 --> 26:03.800
like father, like son.

26:04.620 --> 26:06.390
With our son's score,

26:06.610 --> 26:07.870
aside from Peking University and Tsinghua University,

26:08.050 --> 26:10.120
he can choose any other school in the country.

26:11.570 --> 26:13.060
Chen Rui, Chen Rui,

26:13.080 --> 26:13.590
come.

26:13.590 --> 26:14.270
Come out.

26:14.350 --> 26:15.510
Tell us, which school are you applying to?

26:16.090 --> 26:16.770
Chen Rui!

26:17.550 --> 26:18.570
Which university are you applying to?

26:20.850 --> 26:21.910
Honghuai Normal University.

26:24.580 --> 26:25.150
Wait.

26:25.660 --> 26:26.580
Why?

26:26.600 --> 26:27.600
Because of Ma Siyi.

26:30.650 --> 26:32.200
Are you sure she can get in?

26:32.380 --> 26:33.020
I'm sure.

26:35.900 --> 26:38.130
When I went to pick up your report card at school,

26:38.150 --> 26:39.820
I heard about her situation from the teacher.

26:46.630 --> 26:48.460
She handed in blank papers for every subject.

26:48.480 --> 26:49.120
That's impossible.

26:50.740 --> 26:52.060
Her total score is zero.

27:01.700 --> 27:03.230
Liking someone

27:04.270 --> 27:06.030
really is a beautiful thing.

27:04.530 --> 27:09.390
[Ma Siyi]

27:06.650 --> 27:07.590
Your dad and I

27:07.590 --> 27:09.270
were also once at this age.

27:09.950 --> 27:11.390
But when you like someone,

27:12.630 --> 27:13.790
you can't let that

27:13.820 --> 27:16.060
ruin your own future.

27:18.420 --> 27:19.620
You and Ma Siyi

27:21.340 --> 27:23.470
are destined to miss each other, son.

27:31.630 --> 27:32.500
Wait, this...

27:37.950 --> 27:40.270
Ma Siyi, what do you want?

27:41.070 --> 27:42.510
Why didn't you take the exam seriously?

27:42.830 --> 27:44.510
Why did you hand in blank papers?

27:49.480 --> 27:50.990
Do you know how much it costs

27:50.990 --> 27:51.820
to repeat a year?

27:51.820 --> 27:52.910
Who said I'm going to repeat a year?

27:52.910 --> 27:54.430
Can't I choose not to go to university?

27:58.270 --> 27:58.910
Not...

27:59.740 --> 28:00.600
Not going to university?

28:00.640 --> 28:01.980
Are you going to find a job?

28:02.310 --> 28:04.220
What can you even do?

28:04.560 --> 28:06.200
You can barely support yourself.

28:06.930 --> 28:08.740
You don't need to be concerned about my life.

28:08.760 --> 28:09.590
You didn't care before,

28:09.590 --> 28:10.670
so don't bother me in the future either.

28:13.740 --> 28:14.460
Fine.

28:14.690 --> 28:15.840
You're not going to university, huh?

28:16.500 --> 28:17.060
Okay.

28:17.310 --> 28:18.010
Then quit school.

28:18.500 --> 28:19.210
Just quit.

28:20.190 --> 28:21.270
I should sell this house

28:21.880 --> 28:23.050
as soon as possible.

28:24.200 --> 28:25.420
Why are you selling it?

28:25.790 --> 28:27.950
Flower Street has no future.

28:27.980 --> 28:28.820
And the canal is in decline.

28:28.840 --> 28:30.400
The house prices are dropping day by day.

28:31.750 --> 28:33.170
I've already inquired about it.

28:33.280 --> 28:36.900
This house is worth at least a hundred thousand now.

28:36.930 --> 28:38.330
We can just live off the interest.

28:38.350 --> 28:39.640
Get out!

28:39.790 --> 28:41.320
Get out of here!

28:41.730 --> 28:42.730
Let go of me!

28:42.750 --> 28:43.360
Wait!

28:43.470 --> 28:44.960
It's not your house!

28:45.710 --> 28:46.310
What's going on?

28:46.330 --> 28:47.590
Why are you arguing?

28:47.750 --> 28:49.030
I'm not insisting on doing this.

28:49.070 --> 28:50.180
Why are you getting so worked up?

28:50.210 --> 28:52.010
I have no intention of discussing this with you.

28:52.050 --> 28:53.690
This house is absolutely not for sale.

28:53.710 --> 28:54.750
If you want to invest,

28:54.750 --> 28:55.920
use your own money!

28:55.950 --> 28:57.100
Have you gone crazy from being poor?

28:57.280 --> 28:58.920
This house was left to Siyi by Granny.

28:58.960 --> 28:59.820
What right do you have to sell it?

28:59.850 --> 29:01.010
Siyi, don't worry.

29:01.050 --> 29:01.880
We're all here for you.

29:01.900 --> 29:03.210
She can't take this house away.

29:03.340 --> 29:04.070
We won't let her take it!

29:04.070 --> 29:06.010
I never said I was going to take it.

29:06.080 --> 29:08.090
I'm just trying to discuss this with her reasonably.

29:08.230 --> 29:09.460
Come on, you guys.

29:09.590 --> 29:10.400
Besides,

29:10.420 --> 29:12.290
this house belongs to my mother-in-law.

29:12.390 --> 29:14.390
Technically, I have a right to use it.

29:14.390 --> 29:15.910
You've remarried.

29:16.150 --> 29:17.560
Legally,

29:17.630 --> 29:19.430
Granny Ma is no longer your mother-in-law!

29:19.450 --> 29:20.010
That's right!

29:20.040 --> 29:21.040
Exactly!

29:22.180 --> 29:23.830
Siyi is my own daughter.

29:23.910 --> 29:25.590
Everything I do is for her own good.

29:25.620 --> 29:26.800
If you really want what's best for her,

29:26.830 --> 29:27.790
just keep the house.

29:27.930 --> 29:29.420
Let's not talk about the financial aspect for now.

29:29.470 --> 29:30.780
Emotionally,

29:30.800 --> 29:32.600
this child surely can't bear to let it go.

29:32.640 --> 29:34.230
Yes. Keeping this house

29:34.260 --> 29:36.050
will at least leave this child something to hold on to.

29:36.190 --> 29:37.910
No matter where she goes in the future,

29:37.910 --> 29:38.830
if she gets tired or feels weary,

29:38.830 --> 29:40.030
she'll have a place to return to.

29:40.030 --> 29:40.530
Exactly.

29:40.670 --> 29:42.310
Although the rent from this house doesn't bring in much,

29:42.310 --> 29:43.670
it's still Siyi's home.

29:43.700 --> 29:44.670
You, as her mother...

29:44.710 --> 29:46.830
A home is where family is, okay?

29:46.850 --> 29:48.590
They are my real family!

29:48.830 --> 29:50.350
You abandoned me

29:50.380 --> 29:51.570
when I needed you the most!

29:51.800 --> 29:53.830
How can you expect me to treat you as my mother?

29:57.670 --> 29:59.150
Blood is thicker than water.

30:00.660 --> 30:01.550
No matter what,

30:01.550 --> 30:02.910
I'm still your biological mother.

30:03.340 --> 30:04.580
Grandma is gone,

30:04.800 --> 30:06.470
but I'm still here.

30:06.650 --> 30:07.640
No matter what happens,

30:07.670 --> 30:08.190
I won't

30:08.190 --> 30:09.630
leave you all alone, uncared for.

30:09.630 --> 30:10.390
You?

30:10.390 --> 30:11.270
How are you going to take care of me?

30:11.270 --> 30:12.510
By selling the house, swindling all the money,

30:12.510 --> 30:13.920
and disappearing again?

30:14.440 --> 30:16.390
In the past, you always went to Grandma when you were in trouble.

30:16.470 --> 30:17.680
Now it's me.

30:17.700 --> 30:18.930
You have to squeeze every last bit out of me

30:18.970 --> 30:20.030
before you're satisfied, don't you?

30:21.940 --> 30:23.860
How could you say that?

30:25.090 --> 30:27.010
Every family has its own difficulties.

30:27.150 --> 30:29.240
Then don't be my family!

30:29.560 --> 30:31.290
Who asked you to?

30:33.610 --> 30:34.670
From now on,

30:34.710 --> 30:36.070
you are you and I am me!

30:36.070 --> 30:37.220
We'll live our separate lives.

30:37.550 --> 30:38.710
No matter how difficult or tough it gets for me,

30:38.710 --> 30:40.020
I will never ask you for help!

30:40.160 --> 30:41.130
Siyi,

30:41.700 --> 30:43.600
you didn't even get into university.

30:44.870 --> 30:46.310
I'm not well-off either.

30:46.310 --> 30:47.830
Who's going to support you in the future?

30:47.830 --> 30:48.910
I will!

30:54.620 --> 30:55.670
From now on,

30:55.670 --> 30:56.750
you don't need to worry about Siyi.

30:56.920 --> 30:57.760
She has me,

30:57.800 --> 30:58.810
brothers and sisters,

30:58.870 --> 30:59.790
and the neighbors.

30:59.790 --> 31:00.910
As long as we're here,

31:00.910 --> 31:02.250
we won't let Siyi suffer!

31:02.280 --> 31:03.600
The kid is right!

31:03.690 --> 31:04.120
Yes.

31:04.150 --> 31:04.820
Exactly.

31:04.950 --> 31:06.160
We're all here for her.

31:07.460 --> 31:09.060
You're all family.

31:09.840 --> 31:11.450
You're all family.

31:11.730 --> 31:12.650
Is that enough?

31:14.320 --> 31:16.580
I'm her only enemy here.

31:17.270 --> 31:19.410
You heartless kid.

31:19.800 --> 31:21.280
Fine. I'll get lost.

31:22.620 --> 31:23.870
Siwei!

31:24.030 --> 31:25.650
Your sister finds you annoying!

31:25.860 --> 31:27.060
Let's get lost!

31:27.100 --> 31:28.720
Come on, pack your things!

31:29.060 --> 31:30.170
Pack your things!

31:31.590 --> 31:32.150
Siyi,

31:32.190 --> 31:34.000
don't make me leave!

31:34.000 --> 31:35.280
I'll be good!

31:35.300 --> 31:36.780
I'm not trying to make you leave.

31:36.950 --> 31:37.910
When I get back on my feet,

31:37.910 --> 31:39.180
I'll come to pick you up, okay?

31:39.390 --> 31:40.230
No!

31:40.230 --> 31:41.270
I don't want to go with her,

31:41.270 --> 31:42.220
Siyi.

31:42.950 --> 31:44.030
I'm not capable enough right now.

31:44.030 --> 31:45.630
But when I am,

31:45.630 --> 31:47.320
I'll come to get you, okay, Siwei?

31:47.640 --> 31:48.870
No!

31:50.550 --> 31:51.870
Pinky swear, pinky swear.

31:51.870 --> 31:53.250
I'll definitely come.

31:54.190 --> 31:57.290
Cross my heart, hope to die. Stick a needle in my eye.

31:57.790 --> 31:59.270
Take good care of yourself, okay?

31:59.270 --> 32:02.020
I gave birth to her, and now I'm the bad guy.

32:02.350 --> 32:04.270
Isn't it just because I'm poor?

32:05.830 --> 32:07.370
I'll get lost. Is that enough?

32:09.160 --> 32:10.340
Stop crying!

32:11.970 --> 32:13.250
Take this!

32:13.750 --> 32:14.570
Siyi!

32:14.710 --> 32:15.110
Let's go!

32:15.110 --> 32:16.310
Take good care of yourself, okay?

32:16.630 --> 32:17.750
Siyi!

32:18.820 --> 32:20.350
I'll just pretend I never gave birth to her!

32:20.550 --> 32:21.730
Siyi!

32:22.430 --> 32:23.570
Let's go!

32:24.790 --> 32:25.870
Siyi!

32:26.150 --> 32:27.210
Siyi!

32:35.900 --> 32:37.300
Be careful not to step on his face.

32:41.240 --> 32:43.100
Both of us are going to Beijing.

32:43.120 --> 32:43.960
What about you?

32:44.260 --> 32:45.300
I'm going to Beijing too.

32:45.900 --> 32:46.950
To work and make money.

32:50.410 --> 32:52.210
You're really not going to repeat the year?

32:55.590 --> 32:57.300
Let's talk about the future when it comes.

32:58.220 --> 33:00.300
Anyway, I can't stand staying in Flower Street for even one more day.

33:04.740 --> 33:05.760
Because of your dad?

33:08.020 --> 33:09.230
Now, whenever I see his face,

33:09.230 --> 33:10.760
I get so angry I can't hold it in.

33:11.740 --> 33:12.770
I'm really afraid that one day I...

33:16.300 --> 33:18.020
Actually, your dad is pretty good to you.

33:19.030 --> 33:20.210
He's just a bit naggy,

33:20.230 --> 33:20.910
but he's not a bad person.

33:20.990 --> 33:21.790
I know.

33:23.120 --> 33:24.620
But every time he's drunk, he hits my mom.

33:24.620 --> 33:25.500
I really can't stand it.

33:28.510 --> 33:29.480
I tried to persuade my mom to leave,

33:29.940 --> 33:30.700
but she refuses to.

33:31.190 --> 33:31.960
Why?

33:35.030 --> 33:35.830
Maybe she just can't let go.

33:35.830 --> 33:36.550
I don't know either.

33:39.590 --> 33:40.590
I'll go to Beijing first.

33:41.420 --> 33:42.680
When I make some money and buy a house,

33:43.010 --> 33:44.130
I'll bring my mom over.

33:49.840 --> 33:51.070
They call that capable?

33:51.070 --> 33:52.340
Slow down!

33:52.360 --> 33:55.030
The whole of Flower Street is picking on just me?

33:55.310 --> 33:56.560
Hurry up!

33:56.690 --> 33:58.920
If you don't move fast, your sister will kick you out!

33:58.950 --> 34:00.350
Have you no shame?

34:01.310 --> 34:02.810
Are you bullying me because I don't have a husband?

34:04.520 --> 34:05.360
Siwei.

34:05.770 --> 34:06.570
Siwei.

34:06.590 --> 34:07.800
You're picking on me alone!

34:07.910 --> 34:09.080
Brother-in-law!

34:09.110 --> 34:10.530
What Brother-in-law?

34:10.699 --> 34:12.530
Let's go!

34:12.670 --> 34:13.949
Brother-in-law!

34:14.389 --> 34:15.290
What's wrong?

34:15.590 --> 34:16.550
I want Brother-in-law!

34:16.550 --> 34:17.400
You little shameless brat!

34:17.400 --> 34:18.310
You're so young and already calling someone Brother-in-law!

34:18.310 --> 34:19.440
What's wrong with her mom now?

34:19.550 --> 34:20.110
Brother-in-law!

34:20.110 --> 34:22.110
When I make it big one day,

34:22.110 --> 34:24.040
you won't be able to kiss my ass!

34:24.310 --> 34:25.190
What's going on?

34:25.190 --> 34:26.429
What brother-in-law?

34:26.429 --> 34:27.790
Where is she taking Siwei?

34:28.030 --> 34:29.780
You ungrateful little brat,

34:30.670 --> 34:31.300
let's go!

34:36.120 --> 34:37.510
Your sister likes you, huh?

34:37.770 --> 34:39.139
Then go and live with her!

34:39.250 --> 34:39.889
Get lost!

34:41.190 --> 34:42.590
Get lost!

34:42.590 --> 34:44.310
You said it yourself.

34:44.739 --> 34:46.340
Brother-in-law!

34:47.650 --> 34:48.320
Brother-in-law!

34:48.350 --> 34:49.150
Come back!

34:49.429 --> 34:50.300
Ge Siwei!

34:50.389 --> 34:51.630
Come back here!

34:51.909 --> 34:53.429
Little brat!

34:53.449 --> 34:54.429
Come back here!

34:54.770 --> 34:55.730
Come back!

34:56.489 --> 34:57.520
Ge Siwei!

34:58.550 --> 34:59.570
Come back!

35:01.790 --> 35:02.480
Don't climb over!

35:02.520 --> 35:03.990
Get down!

35:03.990 --> 35:05.230
-Siwei, it's dangerous!
-Stop!

35:05.230 --> 35:06.950
-Siwei!
-Get down! It's dangerous!

35:06.950 --> 35:07.660
-Siwei!
-It's dangerous!

35:08.760 --> 35:09.310
Get down!

35:09.310 --> 35:09.830
There's a ship!

35:09.830 --> 35:10.590
Don't jump!

35:20.770 --> 35:21.450
Siwei!

35:23.510 --> 35:24.270
Siwei!

35:25.670 --> 35:26.790
Siwei!

35:31.860 --> 35:33.300
Siwei!

36:10.150 --> 36:11.410
Siyi!

36:13.380 --> 36:14.100
Siyi!

36:21.630 --> 36:22.670
Your brother...

36:22.690 --> 36:24.010
What happened to my brother?

36:24.190 --> 36:25.310
Your brother, he...

36:28.100 --> 36:29.260
What happened to him?

36:35.610 --> 36:37.630
Why did you call him?

36:37.630 --> 36:38.740
Auntie!

36:38.990 --> 36:40.270
Give me back my son!

36:40.310 --> 36:41.190
Auntie!

36:41.190 --> 36:42.230
Auntie, calm down!

36:42.270 --> 36:44.630
If you hadn't called him, he wouldn't have jumped!

36:44.710 --> 36:45.350
Calm down, calm down!

36:45.390 --> 36:46.910
What do you want?

36:46.910 --> 36:48.390
Give me back my son!

36:49.770 --> 36:51.140
Where's Siwei?

36:52.300 --> 36:53.750
They're still conducting the search and recovery.

36:53.770 --> 36:55.840
So far, only some of his remains have been found.

36:56.010 --> 36:56.610
My condolences.

36:58.620 --> 36:59.700
Your brother's fate...

37:00.370 --> 37:01.620
was so tragic.

37:03.000 --> 37:05.690
They killed him!

37:07.260 --> 37:10.070
They killed him!

37:10.600 --> 37:11.910
Nonsense!

37:12.110 --> 37:13.680
He died because you were chasing him!

37:13.710 --> 37:15.350
He jumped off the bridge to get away from you!

37:15.880 --> 37:16.650
No!

37:16.840 --> 37:17.810
Siyi,

37:18.080 --> 37:19.140
it was not like that.

37:19.340 --> 37:21.070
They killed him!

37:24.620 --> 37:25.740
You bastard!

37:26.050 --> 37:27.470
It was all your fault!

37:27.510 --> 37:28.600
Bastard!

37:29.550 --> 37:32.350
Bastard! Bastard!

37:32.430 --> 37:32.950
Auntie.

37:32.950 --> 37:34.510
Why did you call him?

37:34.550 --> 37:35.660
Calm down, calm down.

37:35.870 --> 37:38.230
If you hadn't called him, he wouldn't have died!

37:38.260 --> 37:40.220
Give me back my son's life!

37:40.710 --> 37:42.460
Give me back my son's life!

37:48.000 --> 37:49.060
Siyi!

37:49.390 --> 37:50.280
Siyi!

37:57.830 --> 37:58.820
It was not your fault.

37:59.710 --> 38:00.890
If anyone's to blame, it's his mother.

38:02.260 --> 38:03.900
She actually had the nerve to turn things around and blame us.

38:06.150 --> 38:07.470
I shouldn't have called him.

38:09.750 --> 38:11.030
If he had just walked straight over,

38:12.060 --> 38:13.620
maybe he wouldn't have jumped.

38:13.720 --> 38:14.670
I've told you

38:14.710 --> 38:15.350
several times

38:15.350 --> 38:15.790
that it wasn't your fault.

38:15.790 --> 38:16.630
Are you out of your mind?

38:16.870 --> 38:17.910
Are you a nagging widow?

38:18.870 --> 38:20.270
If his mom hadn't chased after him,

38:20.300 --> 38:21.610
would Siwei have jumped?

38:21.640 --> 38:22.800
The root cause is his mother.

38:23.710 --> 38:24.270
Stop it.

38:33.740 --> 38:34.880
Siyi,

38:35.820 --> 38:37.240
my mom made wontons

38:37.790 --> 38:38.670
with shepherd's purse filling.

38:39.630 --> 38:40.350
Have some.

38:45.790 --> 38:47.420
At least eat a little.

38:47.670 --> 38:49.130
Otherwise, you won't be able to hold up.

38:51.250 --> 38:53.340
I'll have to go to the hospital to take care of you.

38:54.580 --> 38:56.220
Be good. Just eat ten of them.

39:47.790 --> 39:49.100
I'm just worried she won't be able to handle it.

39:52.270 --> 39:53.070
Why don't we...

39:53.560 --> 39:55.680
go down and talk to Siyi for a bit?

39:58.450 --> 39:59.770
What should we say when we see her?

40:04.310 --> 40:05.030
Then what should we do?

40:06.550 --> 40:07.350
Fenghua is with her.

40:08.220 --> 40:10.210
Siyi won't do anything drastic.

40:13.420 --> 40:14.480
Mom, hurry up.

40:14.510 --> 40:15.610
Get me two more.

40:36.710 --> 40:37.500
Siyi,

40:38.230 --> 40:39.000
open the door.

40:44.600 --> 40:45.340
Siyi?

40:49.450 --> 40:50.360
Siyi.

41:14.000 --> 41:15.250
Have some wontons.

41:16.540 --> 41:17.430
I'll leave them here for you.

41:36.820 --> 41:37.990
My mom said,

41:38.050 --> 41:39.930
if you want to cry, just cry out loud.

41:40.010 --> 41:41.030
Don't hold it in.

41:41.070 --> 41:42.200
It's bad for your health.

41:44.300 --> 41:45.120
I've already cried.

41:47.410 --> 41:48.490
How come I didn't hear you cry?

41:50.510 --> 41:51.790
If you don't know what to say, then say nothing.

41:54.370 --> 41:55.840
Let's sleep together tonight.

41:55.870 --> 41:56.900
You can hide under the blanket and cry.

41:57.260 --> 41:57.780
And I'll be with you.

42:00.630 --> 42:02.010
No need. I'm really fine.

42:02.580 --> 42:05.410
Stop it. You've always been like this since you were a kid.

42:05.780 --> 42:06.800
When you're hurt,

42:06.820 --> 42:09.010
you always keep it inside and never tell anyone.

42:09.620 --> 42:11.430
My mom said it can cause breast cancer.

42:11.450 --> 42:12.780
Can I ask you a favor?

42:14.210 --> 42:15.130
Go ahead.

42:15.310 --> 42:16.420
Go out with me for a walk.

42:28.070 --> 42:29.240
Before the college entrance exam,

42:30.470 --> 42:32.590
Siwei dreamed of Grandma.

42:33.420 --> 42:35.010
He dreamt of her

42:35.550 --> 42:37.210
riding a bike with Grandpa.

42:37.960 --> 42:39.260
I was so angry.

42:40.700 --> 42:41.940
Why were you angry?

42:42.450 --> 42:44.020
Grandma appeared in his dream

42:44.350 --> 42:45.430
but ignored me.

42:47.030 --> 42:48.670
She didn't want you to be sad.

42:49.470 --> 42:50.510
She couldn't bear to see that.

42:57.240 --> 42:58.120
Look ahead.

42:59.260 --> 43:00.180
Granny's gone,

43:00.800 --> 43:01.650
but we're still here.
